#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.1.rst:338
msgid ""
"None of this affects MicroPython scripts. ``py_image.c`` was split, with the"
" descriptor objects (cascade, keypoints, LBP, keypoint match) moving to "
"``py_image_descriptor.c`` and the statistics objects (similarity, "
"statistics, percentile, threshold, histogram) to ``py_image_stats.c``. The "
"imlib encoder API was aligned with the rest of imlib: ``jpeg_compress`` / "
"``png_compress`` return ``0`` on success and ``-1`` on error, and "
"``jpeg_compress`` lost its ``realloc`` argument (resizing is gated on buffer"
" ownership). ``OMV_PROTOCOL_MAX_CHANNELS`` became "
"``OMV_PROTOCOL_CHANNEL_MAX`` in ``omv_protocol_channel.h``, and ports now "
"call ``py_protocol_init0()`` on init. The ``OMV_PAG7936_MIPI_CSI2`` board "
"define is gone (the interface is selected at runtime). CI dependency bumps "
"and an empty-release-changelog fix round it out. See the `firmware "
"repository <https://github.com/openmv/openmv>`__ history for fork-relevant "
"detail."
msgstr ""
"Mikään tästä ei vaikuta MicroPython-skripteihin. ``py_image.c`` jaettiin "
"osiin: kuvaajaobjektit (cascade, keypoints, LBP, keypoint match) siirtyivät "
"tiedostoon ``py_image_descriptor.c`` ja tilasto-objektit (similarity, "
"statistics, percentile, threshold, histogram) tiedostoon "
"``py_image_stats.c``\\ . imlib-enkooderirajapinta yhdenmukaistettiin muun "
"imlibin kanssa: ``jpeg_compress`` / ``png_compress`` palauttavat ``0`` "
"onnistuessaan ja ``-1`` virheen sattuessa, ja ``jpeg_compress`` menetti "
"``realloc``\\ -argumenttinsa (koon muuttaminen riippuu puskurin "
"omistajuudesta). ``OMV_PROTOCOL_MAX_CHANNELS`` muuttui muotoon "
"``OMV_PROTOCOL_CHANNEL_MAX`` tiedostossa ``omv_protocol_channel.h``\\ , ja "
"portit kutsuvat nyt alustuksessa funktiota ``py_protocol_init0()``\\ . "
"``OMV_PAG7936_MIPI_CSI2``\\ -korttimäärittely on poistettu (liitäntä "
"valitaan ajon aikana). CI-riippuvuuksien päivitykset ja tyhjän "
"julkaisumuutoslokin korjaus täydentävät kokonaisuuden. Katso forkkeja "
"koskevat yksityiskohdat `laiteohjelmistorepositorion "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv>`__ historiasta."

